  "notes": [
    {
      "placement": "comparison",
      "text": "The Erasmus reference programme combines criminology with law, sociology, psychology and continuous empirical research training. UCR has one explicitly crime-focused course, Criminal Law & Criminal Justice; the broader pathways therefore approach crime and justice through law, psychology, sociology, politics, philosophy, conflict, history and media rather than implying a full criminology curriculum."
    }
  ]
